# actions are values too: "action double" hands the action itself to someone else.

me can double n
    give n * 2

me can is_even n
    give n % 2 is 0

me can name_size word
    give size of word

me has nums me numbers 1 6
say nums
say me change_each nums (action double)
say me keep nums (action is_even)
say me sort_by (list "mammoth" "ox" "cat") (action name_size)

# hold an action in a thing, and call it later
me has todo action double
say me call todo 21
